                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a collection of mediocre games. I liked X8 the most because of how different (and better) it is compared to the others. The games in the first collection are leagues better than the ones in here. If you skip these, the only thing you'd be missing out on is getting bored occasionally on some of the games, but despite that, I still enjoyed playing. Even if they're kind of mid, for 4 games I'd say it's worth it, especially on a sale and if you have enough patience and motivation to play through them.",
